    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "wallet: importdescriptors should output the request on error",
    "user": {
      "login": "kevkevinpal",
      "id": 15950706,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTUwNzA2",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15950706?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/kevkevinpal",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kevkevinpal/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "## Motivation\r\nWhen `importdescriptors` is given multiple requests, a missing `timestamp` still fails the whole call with a static error (`Missing required timestamp field for key`). That does not say which request failed.\r\n\r\n#34861 is merged. Other parse failures are returned per item, but a missing or invalid timestamp is still a top-level RPC error from `GetImportTimestamp`.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nInclude the failing request in that error message.\r\n\r\n## Example\r\nRequest\r\n```json\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    \"desc\": \"wpkh([abcd1234/84h/1h/0h]tpub.../0/*)#x9abc123\",\r\n    \"timestamp\": 1710000000,\r\n    \"active\": true,\r\n    \"range\": [0, 100]\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"desc\": \"pkh(039dcc64c5c644baf0145a5f7322b16399a01a0ee2a182e3150946fe7946358247)#68u5tv65\",\r\n    \"active\": false\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"code\": -3,\r\n  \"message\": \"Missing required timestamp field for key\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"code\": -3,\r\n  \"message\": \"Missing required timestamp field for import request: {\\\"desc\\\":\\\"pkh(039dcc64c5c644baf0145a5f7322b16399a01a0ee2a182e3150946fe7946358247)#68u5tv65\\\",\\\"active\\\":false}\"\r\n}\r\n```",
